  ultimateText: "To\xE1i Ki\u1EBFm Quy Huy\u1EBFt: ti\xEAu 20% m\xE1u hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i,
    g\u0103m t\u1ED1i \u0111a 3 \u0111\u1ECBch 2\xD7; sau 0,8s thu m\u1EA3nh 3\xD7
    v\xE0 h\u1ED3i 8% m\xE1u m\u1ED7i m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu."
  passiveText: "Huy\u1EBFt \xDD: m\u1ED7i 10% m\xE1u m\u1EA5t +5% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    (t\u1ED1i \u0111a 35%); t\u1EF1 h\u1EA1 \u0111\u1ECBch h\u1ED3i 6% m\xE1u, h\u1ED3i
    chi\xEAu 2s."
  minorText: "Hi\u1EBFn Huy\u1EBFt: ti\xEAu 15% m\xE1u hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i; 6s +40%
    c\xF4ng, ch\xE9m t\u1ED1i \u0111a 2 \u0111\u1ECBch v\xE0 h\u1ED3i 4% m\xE1u m\u1ED7i
    \u0111\xF2n tr\xFAng. H\u1ED3i 10s."
  secondMinorText: "Ph\u1EA3n Huy\u1EBFt: d\u01B0\u1EDBi 40% m\xE1u, \u0111\u1EE1
    50% \u0111\xF2n tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn trong 1,5s r\u1ED3i
    ph\u1EA3n ch\xE9m 2\xD7, h\u1ED3i 8% m\xE1u. H\u1ED3i 8s."
